  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Determines if the specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> is the\n<a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> that was <a href=\"#attach(org.springframework.core.env.Environment)\"><code>attached</code></a>\nto the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "确定特定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 是否是已 <a href=\"#attach(org.springframework.core.env.Environment)\"><code>附加</code></a>\n到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 的\n<a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a set of <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> instances that have previously\nbeen <a href=\"#attach(org.springframework.core.env.Environment)\"><code>attached</code></a> to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一组已<a href=\"#attach(org.springframework.core.env.Environment)\"><code>attached</code></a>到<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>的<a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>environment</code> - the source environment (must be an instance of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>environment</code> - 源环境（必须是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a> 的实例）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This method will flatten any nested property sources and will filter all\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.StubPropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>stub property sources</code></a>. Updates to the underlying source,\nidentified by changes in the sources returned by its iterator, will be\nautomatically tracked. The underlying source should be thread safe, for example a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/MutablePropertySources.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>MutablePropertySources</code></a>",
      "translation": "此方法将展平任何嵌套的属性源，并过滤所有\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.StubPropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>stub property sources</code></a>。对底层源的更新，通过其迭代器返回的源中的变化来识别，将被自动跟踪。底层源应该是线程安全的，例如一个\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/MutablePropertySources.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>MutablePropertySources</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The attached resolver will dynamically track any additions or removals from the\nunderlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> property sources.",
      "translation": "附加的解析器将动态跟踪底层 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 属性源的任何添加或删除。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertyResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertyResolver</code></a> that resolves property values against an\nunderlying set of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySources.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySources</code></a>. Provides an\n<a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> aware and optimized alternative to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySourcesPropertyResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySourcesPropertyResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertyResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertyResolver</code></a>，该解析器针对底层的一组 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySources.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySources</code></a> 解析属性值。提供了一个对 <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> 感知且优化的替代方案，用于替代 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySourcesPropertyResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySourcesPropertyResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> containing a single new <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a>\nadapted from the given Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a>. The single element can be\n<code>null</code> if the source cannot be adapted.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含单个新 <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>，该元素是从给定的 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 适配而来的。如果无法适配该源，则单个元素可以是 <code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> containing new <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a>\ninstances adapted from the given Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySources</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回包含从给定的 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySources</code></a> 适配而来的新 <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> 实例的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> containing a single new <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a>\nadapted from the given Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含单个新 <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>，该新对象是根据给定的 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 适配而成的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Attach a <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> support to the specified\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将 <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> 支持附加到指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides access to <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySources</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供对<a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySources</code></a>的访问。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>propertySources</code> - the set of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> objects to use",
      "translation": "<code>propertySources</code> - 要使用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 对象集合",
      "count": 2
